      "disposition": "Visit_Scheduled_Hot",
      "dispositionType": "success",
      "prompt": "Set this when the user agrees to visit a particular dealership and not just a dealership location within 8 days for a test ride or booking/dealer callback for at least one of the discussed models (their initial choice or the pitched model), and a date or time has been confirmed for test ride/dealer visit/dealer callback. The user has to agree to visit a particular dealer for this. Set this disposition when user says they are planning to buy on a later date or around festivals like Holi, Diwali, Durga Pooja, etc where these festivals are within 8 days away. Also mark this if they agree for a dealer visit around festivals like Holi, Diwali, Durga Pooja etc and the festival is within 8 days awayDo not mark if you merely suggested for a test ride/ booking dealer/dealer callback, the user must explicitly agree for it. Mark if the user explicitly provides a date or time for test ride/ booking dealer or explicitly agrees for a dealer callback/visit/booking at a time suggested by you. and the date or day should be within the 8 days time frame . dont mark when the user agrees to visit a dealership within 8 days for a test ride or booking/dealer callback but does not give date or time . do not mark if the customer isplanning to buy whitin 8 days and agreed for a test drive but didnt give date / time .",
      "_id": "6907a7900188ee4672115d63"
    },
