      "prompt": "Set this for the following cases:\n\n-Set this when the user states they are busy or cannot talk now and explicitly agrees for the AI agent to call them back at a later time.\n\n-Set this if the conversation ended abruptly or no conclusion can be drawn. Set this if the conversation ends abruptly (e.g., call drop, call put on hold) before any clear interest or specific next step (like booking a visit or requesting expert help) was agreed upon.\n\n\n- Do not set this if the agent arranged for a callback from the dealership for test ride/booking",
